# M7 flow (D-107, E47): the finale and the whole ending without a single
# input after the clear. The grey box `m7_finale` stands on the journey's
# last station (Café Zauner), so its clear in the real flow (start = title)
# runs the ending. Title → START (21) → intro → play from 171; three
# Oblaten, a jump onto the counter touches the armed goal_stollen in the
# air (464: 10 000 + „Zaunerstollen!"), she lands (468), the Serve (90
# frames, to 558), the tally (56 s left, to 614), the clear panel (180),
# then the ending: Map 794, Scene 1034, Bill 1394, Credits 1994 (6 pages
# of 180), Ende 3074, and after its 600 frames the title (3674) with the
# run reset and the „durchgespielt" mark.
level  = m7_finale
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
route  = salzburg st_gilgen brunnwinkl falkenstein st_wolfgang wolfgangsee strobl bad_ischl m7_finale
expect = complete frames=464..464 deaths=0 event=OblateCollected
expect = state=title cleared=true stage=cafe_zauner score=0 lives=3 oblaten=0 power=normal
---
- 20
S 1       # frame 21: START → intro
- 150     # play from 171
R 260
RJ 20     # onto the counter
R 30      # goal_stollen at 464
- 3300    # Serve, tally, clear, the whole ending, the title (3674)
